    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"BasicMongoPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>BasicMongoPersistentEntity</code></a> with the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个带有给定<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"类或接口在 org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>的新的<a href=\"BasicMongoPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping 中的类\"><code>BasicMongoPersistentEntity</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"BasicMongoPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>BasicMongoPersistentEntity</code></a> with the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>. Will default the\ncollection name to the entities simple type name.",
      "translation": "创建一个带有给定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a> 的新 <a href=\"BasicMongoPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>BasicMongoPersistentEntity</code></a>。集合名称将默认为实体的简单类型名称。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "As a general note: An implicit id property has a name that matches \"id\" or \"_id\". An explicit id property is one\nthat is annotated with @see <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/annotation/Id.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.annotation\"><code>Id</code></a>. The property id is updated according to the following rules: 1) An id\nproperty which is defined explicitly takes precedence over an implicitly defined id property. 2) In case of any\nambiguity a @see <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/MappingException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>MappingException</code></a> is thrown.",
      "translation": "一般说明：隐式 id 属性的名称匹配\"id\"或\"_id\"。显式 id 属性是指使用@see <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/annotation/Id.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.annotation\"><code>Id</code></a>注解的属性。id 属性的更新遵循以下规则：1) 显式定义的 id 属性优先于隐式定义的 id 属性。2) 如果出现任何歧义，将抛出@see <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/MappingException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>MappingException</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
